data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"query\": \"senior no college offers yet\",\n    \"videos\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7661339384515546381\",\n        \"caption\": \"Part #2 - No College Offers Yet_ Here Is Your Senior Year Recruiting Plan The Senior Year Sprint | Video 5 | Part 2 🎯 Here is what the next 90 days needs to look like. July is your reset month. Run the Four Part Fit Test. Rebuild your school list. Get in a coach's inbox before fall practice starts. If you are not, you are already a step behind. 🚨 September and October are your momentum months. Consistent follow up separates the families who get responses from the families who get silence. 💪 November is your decision month. Visits. Real conversations. Decisions made with your head and not just your heart. The family that follows this framework commits in November with confidence. The family that does not is scrambling in January with desperation. That is the difference between a plan and a hope. 🎯 Watch the final video of the Senior Year Sprint now. Link in my bio. 👆 🎯 Grab my free College Recruiting Jumpstart Pack at KeithMondillo.com. Four guides in one. No cost. No catch. #athleticscholarships #athleticrecruitment #aaubasketball #aauvolleyball #collegebasketball #keithmondillo\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-11T20:00:00.000Z\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.tiktok.com/@coachkeithrecruiting/video/7661339384515546381\",\n        \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-p-0068-tx/oAIgA3avLAAizkAlalKQlBWSikiEI5A4lBsvB~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:500:800.jpeg?biz_tag=musically_video.video_cover&dr=9638&idc=useast5&ps=13740610&refresh_token=c0fb78d2&shcp=9b759fb9&shp=c1333099&t=4d5b0474&x-expires=1794002400&x-signature=Yf7Kj6YYRwqLBlezk2LLb27eQLs%3D\",\n        \"durationMs\": 163301,\n        \"pinned\": false,\n        \"isAd\": false,\n        \"stats\": {\n          \"views\": 6779,\n          \"likes\": 106,\n          \"c