       },\n        \"media\": {\n          \"downloadUrl\": \"https://v16m.tiktokcdn-us.com/6ca17425bd2cf5643e2f5580b1d7cdc9/6aee5bc1/video/tos/useast8/tos-useast8-ve-0068c003-tx2/owqPVNFB4BhIVAFVeEEE5lIQSBCKAFfEISWDEu/?a=1233&bti=NEBzNTY6QGo6OjZALnAjNDQuYCMxNDNg&&bt=1783&ft=arR-Iqq2m0nPD12vUtEI3wUQzI8AMeF~O5&mime_type=video_mp4&rc=Zzg8N2U0PGQ3ZTZoPDk7ZkBpMzQ7eHg5cmhvOzMzaTgzNEAuYDE2NTE2NmMxL2NgNjY0YSNrNjYtMmQ0Ni9hLS1kLzJzcw%3D%3D&vvpl=1&l=2026110616574959C8CCD3223D5F16CB02&btag=e00090000\",\n          \"downloadWithoutWatermarkUrl\": \"https://v16m.tiktokcdn-us.com/ee00e6eaa6fa0a845dada82ca01b822c/6aee5bc1/video/tos/useast8/tos-useast8-pve-0068-tx2/o8BSAVhBhFwTBCVQIqEDeOfuEC9OASK5EVF4EV/?a=1233&bti=NEBzNTY6QGo6OjZALnAjNDQuYCMxNDNg&&bt=1862&ft=arR-Iqq2m0nPD12vUtEI3wUQzI8AMeF~O5&mime_type=video_mp4&rc=aWRkZjk8OzY4NTVlNGRlZUBpMzQ7eHg5cmhvOzMzaTgzNEBeYi8tNl82NTIxLzY1MGE1YSNrNjYtMmQ0Ni9hLS1kLzJzcw%3D%3D&vvpl=1&l=2026110616574959C8CCD3223D5F16CB02&btag=e00090000\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7655531368692075790\",\n        \"caption\": \"Going into the summer before my senior year, I had exactly zero college offers. Honestly? I was terrified. I thought my dream of playing college football was slipping through my fingers. Football was my first love, but my own coach looked me in the eye and said, “Good luck. I’m not helping you get into a school.” Hearing that from someone I trusted hurt more than I can explain. But what really crushed my pride happened during track season. My junior year, Coach Rob demoted me to JV in front of the entire team. I was the only 11th grader out there. That moment broke me. But looking back, it also lit a fire inside me that has never gone out. I made a decision that changed my life forever: I joined the church track team. I attacked that summer with everything I had in me. I became stronger, faster, and tougher both mentally and physically. When my senior year finally came around, Coach Rob pulled me aside. He said, “Shawn, you’ve changed. You’re not immature anymore. You’re serious. You want to be great, and you’re working to be great. Your grades are all A’s and B’s, and it’s showing on the track.” That meant everything to me. By the end of my senior year, I wasn’t just on Varsity—I had become one of the fastest seniors in the entire state of Texas. Athletes, hear me when I say this: DO NOT waste your summer. One single summer of sacrifice, discipline, and absolute consistency can completely rewrite your story. I thought I would never make it to college. Football was my passion, but track became my way out. Tap into your summer. Lock in. It might just change your family’s future forever. I know it changed mine. ⏳⚡️ What are you sacrificing this summer to get where you want to be? Let me know in the comments. 👇🏾 #underdogstory #studentathlete #grindszn #trackandfield #motivatīondaily\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-06-26T02:51:59.000Z\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.tiktok.com/@dallaslavishfitness/video/7655531368692075790\",\n        \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-p-85c255-tx/oAKAZEFeTEDYPhATleLAfxEBo9IJGtLOI2Ve6F~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:500:800.jpeg?biz_tag=musically_video.video_cover&dr=9638&idc=useast5&ps=13740610&refresh_token=2bb0aa65&shcp=9b759fb9&shp=c1333099&t=4d5b0474&x-expires=1794002400&x-signature=4zwX%2BWs5JGpQzBkM7%2FbbE5kaJ4o%3D\",\n        \"durationMs\": 57856,\n        \"pinned\": false,\n        \"isAd\": false,\n        \"stats\": {\n          \"views\": 5306,\n          \"likes\": 110,\n          \"comments\": 1,\n          \"shares\": 79,\n          \"saves\": 17\n        },\n        \"media\": {\n          \"downloadUrl\": null,\n          \"downloadWithoutWatermarkUrl\": null\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7660972171627384078\",\n        \"caption\": \"Highlight Reel of No College Offers Yet_ Here Is Your Senior Year Recruiting Plan The Senior Year Sprint | Video 5 Highlights 🚨 The window for senior year recruiting is not unlimited. Every week that passes without proactive communication is a week another athlete is filling a roster spot that could have belonged to your kid. The families who win senior year recruiting are not always the most talented. They are the ones who move with urgency and a clear plan. 💪 The athletes who get recruited late were not always the most gifted in the gym. They were the most prepared. The most consistent. The most committed. They refused to be invisible. 🎯 The final video of the Senior Year Sprint is live right now. Link in my bio. 👆 💪 Ready to go deeper? The Senior Year Recruiting Sprint is waiting for you at KeithMondillo.com I am not a recruiting service. I am an educational platform that educates families through the college athletic recruiting process. #athleticscholarships #athleticrecruitment #aaubasketball #aauvolleyball #collegebasketball #keithmondillo\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-10T18:45:03.000Z\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.tiktok.com/@coachkeithrecruiting/video/7660972171627384078\",\n        \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-p-0068-tx/oIPBziaBwUABn7YifA1KBAAxEPR1aKIFJUkBDJ~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:500:800.jpeg?biz_tag=musically_video.video_cover&dr=9638&idc=useast5&ps=13740610&refresh_token=933b2387&shcp=9b759fb9&shp=c1333099&t=4d5b0474&x-expires=1794002400&x-signature=19A2kN7PJWMkazxJUMTZQCZmbow%3D\",\n        \"durationMs\": 133001,\n        \"pinned\": false,\n        \"isAd\": false,\n        \"stats\": {\n          \"views\": 343,\n          \"likes\": 7,\n          \"comments\": 1,\n          \"shares\": 2,\n          \"saves\": 1\n        },\n        \"media\": {\n          \"downloadUrl\": \"https://v16m.tiktokcdn-us.com/cd930c32f609930ef52deb8929b43f43/6aee5bf3/video/tos/useast5/tos-useast5-ve-0068c002-tx/ogFIRebegvbEk9oCDEbGeH8rsNALAmnAsTsURH/?a=1233&bti=NEBzNTY6QGo6OjZALnAjNDQuYCMxNDNg&&bt=686&ft=arR-Iqq2m0nPD12vUtEI3wUQzI8AMeF~O5&mime_type=video